    You can negate the effects of a number of face-up cards on the field, up to the
    total Link Rating of Link Monsters equipped to this card, until the end of this
    turn. If this card is sent to the GY: You can shuffle 1 other LIGHT Fiend monster
    from your GY into the Deck/Extra Deck, then target 1 card on the field; send
    it to the GY. You can only use each effect of "Fiendsmith''s Desirae" once per
    turn.'
